                "content": "<div class=\"sof-scale\"><div class=\"sof sof-sec sof-formats\"><div class=\"sof-in\"><div class=\"sof-eyebrow\"><b>HOW THE TWO DAYS RUN</b><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><h2 class=\"sof-ftitle\"><span class=\"sof-art sof-t-d\"><img src=\"https://assets.lightfunnels.com/account-90380/images_library/b50aa558-ce47-44c3-aa2f-c49be669068b.webp\" alt=\"Three formats. Zero filler.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"sof-art sof-t-m sof-ft1\"><img src=\"https://assets.lightfunnels.com/account-90380/images_library/f869ac78-4594-477a-b6a6-76dfb04b46d2.webp\" alt=\"Three formats.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"sof-art sof-t-m sof-ft2\"><img src=\"https://assets.lightfunnels.com/account-90380/images_library/3a64a4ae-ebd6-41ba-9c48-bb3dcaec7636.webp\" alt=\"Zero filler.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"sof-vh\">Three formats. Zero filler.</span></h2><p class=\"sof-subline\">EVERY SESSION IS BUILT TO SEND YOU HOME WITH SOMETHING YOU CAN SHIP ON MONDAY.</p><div class=\"sof-fcards\"><div class=\"sof-fcard\"><div class=\"sof-fcard-img\"><img src=\"https://assets.lightfunnels.com/account-90380/images_library/accb3199-6a39-45cf-b27c-0e0af19f88e0.webp\" alt=\"Two operators on stage mid-interview\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><div class=\"sof-fcard-body\"><p class=\"sof-fkick\">01 \u00b7 LIVE INTERVIEWS</p><p class=\"sof-fhead\">OPERATORS GRILLED ON STAGE.</p><p class=\"sof-fbody sof-rich\">Unscripted conversations with the people actually running brands. Real numbers, real mistakes, and what they\u2019d do differently. Nothing pre-approved, nothing polished.</p></div></div><div class=\"sof-fcard\"><div class=\"sof-fcard-img\"><img src=\"https://assets.lightfunnels.com/account-90380/images_library/ec6957c2-1e6f-40b3-8e01-27a87d62d2db.webp\" alt=\"A speaker presenting a system on the main stage\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><i aria