                "content": "<div class=\"sof-scale\"><div class=\"sof sof-sec sof-decide\" id=\"about\"><picture class=\"sof-decide-pic\"><source media=\"(max-width:1023px)\" srcset=\"https://assets.lightfunnels.com/account-90380/images_library/351c41ab-1c64-433d-89e6-eacb22110614.webp\"><img class=\"sof-decide-bg\" src=\"https://assets.lightfunnels.com/account-90380/images_library/8cf38f3b-bde6-433c-b13d-b702aa2e012e.webp\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture><div class=\"sof-decide-wash\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"sof-in\"><p class=\"sof-kicker\">YOU DECIDE:</p><h2 class=\"sof-decide-head\"><span class=\"sof-vh\">Are you scaling or failing?</span><span class=\"sof-decide-art\"><img src=\"https://assets.lightfunnels.com/account-90380/images_library/63929565-36fb-4381-ac9d-378d944b28be.png\" alt=\"Are you scaling or failing?\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></span></h2><p class=\"sof-decide-body sof-decide-intro sof-only-d sof-rich\"><strong>Scaling or Failing</strong> has been our underground community since 2024. <br><br>Behind closed doors, it\u2019s helped countless <br>brands hit six, even seven-figure days.</p><p class=\"sof-decide-body sof-decide-intro sof-only-m sof-rich\"><strong>Scaling or Failing</strong> has been our underground community since 2024. <br><br>Behind closed doors, it\u2019s helped countless <br>brands hit six, even seven-figure days.</p><p class=\"sof-decide-body sof-decide-promise sof-rich\">Until now, every mastermind has been private. <br>This December we go live, big time. <br><br>Cu in Bangkok! </p></div></div></div>"
